<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:14:06 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>衰老敏感的分泌型磷脂酶具有神经保护和认知弹性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/an-aging-sensitive-secreted-phospholipase-confers-neuroprotection-and-cognitive-resilience</link><description>这项研究确定了海马齿状回中的一种分泌性磷脂酶，它介导衰老敏感的代偿机制，促进认知弹性和神经保护。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/an-aging-sensitive-secreted-phospholipase-confers-neuroprotection-and-cognitive-resilience.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:14:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/an-aging-sensitive-secreted-phospholipase-confers-neuroprotection-and-cognitive-resilience</guid></item><item><title>脊髓室管膜瘤：对分子分类、治疗指南和临床结果的全面综述，重点关注儿科人群（室管膜瘤的第三部分） — Journal of Neuro-Oncology</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/spinal-ependymoma-a-comprehensive-review-of-molecular-classification-management-guidelines-and-clinical-outcomes-with-a-focus-on-the-pediatric-population-part-iii-of-ependymomas-across-compartment</link><description>脊髓室管膜瘤是中枢神经系统的罕见肿瘤，具有不同的解剖学、组织学和分子亚型。本综述旨在综合有关脊柱室管膜瘤的表现、诊断、手术治疗、辅助治疗和结果的当前证据，重点关注儿科人群。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/spinal-ependymoma-a-comprehensive-review-of-molecular-classification-management-guidelines-and-clinical-outcomes-with-a-focus-on-the-pediatric-population-part-iii-of-ependymomas-across-compartment2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:59:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/spinal-ependymoma-a-comprehensive-review-of-molecular-classification-management-guidelines-and-clinical-outcomes-with-a-focus-on-the-pediatric-population-part-iii-of-ependymomas-across-compartment</guid></item><item><title>运动神经元激活意想不到的防御，在 ALS 相关蛋白凝结之前将其清除</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/motor-neurons-activate-unexpected-defense-to-clear-als-linked-protein-before-it-clumps</link><description>ALS 是一种疾病，在大多数情况下，蛋白质在神经元中形成聚集，导致运动控制迅速丧失和死亡。名古屋大学的一个研究小组在人类神经元细胞培养物和小鼠中发现了一种意想不到的防御机制，神经元会打开这种机制来避免这些聚集物，从而为开发治疗方法提供了一条新的潜在途径。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/motor-neurons-activate-unexpected-defense-to-clear-als-linked-protein-before-it-clumps.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:44:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/motor-neurons-activate-unexpected-defense-to-clear-als-linked-protein-before-it-clumps</guid></item><item><title>即使在考虑了健康和生活方式之后，也能帮助其他与看起来更年轻的成年人大脑相关的人</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/helping-others-linked-to-younger-looking-adult-brains-even-after-accounting-for-health-and-lifestyle</link><description>人口调查和研究表明，有意义的社会联系是健康和长寿的有力预测因素。换句话说，对社会群体的归属感和牢固的社会纽带似乎与更好的健康和更长的寿命有关。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/helping-others-linked-to-younger-looking-adult-brains-even-after-accounting-for-health-and-lifestyle2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:29:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/helping-others-linked-to-younger-looking-adult-brains-even-after-accounting-for-health-and-lifestyle</guid></item><item><title>意识的功能|亚历山大·克莱因</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-function-of-consciousness-alexander-klein</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:14:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-function-of-consciousness-alexander-klein</guid></item><item><title>我们的外太空未来，与 Max More</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/our-extropian-future-with-max-more</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:59:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/our-extropian-future-with-max-more</guid></item><item><title>我们可以将我们的大脑连接到量子计算机吗？ 🧠💻</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/could-we-connect-our-brains-to-a-quantum-computer-%f0%9f%a7%a0%f0%9f%92%bb</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:44:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/could-we-connect-our-brains-to-a-quantum-computer-%f0%9f%a7%a0%f0%9f%92%bb</guid></item><item><title>科学家发现癌细胞自我毁灭的触发因素</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-discover-a-trigger-for-cancer-cells-self-destruction</link><description>研究人员发现，当癌细胞被压缩或紧紧限制时，它们就会开始一个导致自我毁灭的过程。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-discover-a-trigger-for-cancer-cells-self-destruction.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:29:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-discover-a-trigger-for-cancer-cells-self-destruction</guid></item><item><title>蝙蝠的病毒免疫力可能延长了它们的寿命</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/bats-viral-immunity-may-have-driven-their-long-lifespans</link><description>了解长寿动物如何抵抗癌症和衰老影响可以为人类管理这些疾病提供解决方案。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/bats-viral-immunity-may-have-driven-their-long-lifespans2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:14:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/bats-viral-immunity-may-have-driven-their-long-lifespans</guid></item><item><title>据称人工智能生成的论文滥用开放神经影像数据</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/alleged-ai-generated-papers-misuse-open-neuroimaging-data</link><description>神经科学家发现了已发表论文的证据，这些论文可能使用人工智能来伪造对公共脑部扫描数据集的分析，引发了对研究诚信的担忧。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/alleged-ai-generated-papers-misuse-open-neuroimaging-data2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:59:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/alleged-ai-generated-papers-misuse-open-neuroimaging-data</guid></item></channel></rss>